        "answer": "[2, 1]ᵀ",
        "hint": "The weights are 0 and 1, so only the second column survives.",
        "explanation": "Ax = 0·[1, 3]ᵀ + 1·[2, 1]ᵀ = [2, 1]ᵀ."
