      "id": "order",
      "title": "Order matters",
      "shortTitle": "AB ≠ BA",
      "categoryId": "building-the-product",
      "summary": "In general, AB and BA are different. Sometimes only one is defined. Even when both exist and have the same shape, their entries need not agree.",
