          "Both AB and BA exist",
          "Only BA exists",
          "Neither exists"
        ],
        "answer": "Only AB exists",
        "hint": "AB matches 3 with 3. For BA, compare 4 with 2.",
        "explanation": "AB exists and is 2 × 4. BA would require 4 = 2, so BA is undefined."
      },
      "interactions": [
